      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks! that's a pretty good start and it sounds natural. but i just ran a quick mock scan on it and the score was actually kinda low—maybe like a 6 or 7 out of 50 or something. i'm worried it won't even make it past the first filter if the score isn't higher. \n\ncan you try another version? i still want it to sound professional and not like a robot, but we really need to get that score up. try to find more ways to naturally integrate those keywords so the count is higher, but please, just make sure it still reads like a real person. i don't want the recruiter to think i'm just spamming their values.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
